CLASSIFIED MISSION FILE -- ASSASSINATION OF THE FOURTH KAZEKAGE
Kazekage Office eyes only. Highest seal.

Subject: The murder of the Fourth Kazekage and the deception that followed.

Reconstruction of events: In the period preceding the joint operation against
Konohagakure, the Fourth Kazekage entered into secret alliance with Orochimaru,
leader of Otogakure. Unknown to the village, Orochimaru had already turned on
his partner. He assassinated the Fourth in secret and, using his forbidden
arts, assumed the Kazekage's very appearance.

Under that stolen face, Orochimaru led Sunagakure's forces into the assault on
the Leaf, intending the Sand as expendable pawns against his true enemy. The
deception was uncovered only in the course of the operation, when the false
Kazekage revealed himself.

Aftermath: Sunagakure severed all ties with the Sound and repudiated the
invasion. Every future Kazekage's identity is now subject to verification
protocols. The Fourth's remains and his sealing of the One-Tail into Lord Gaara
are recorded in the succession file. Retained under permanent classification.
